# Sources are not published here. The LaTeX lives in the book's own repository;
# this one carries the compiled PDFs. These patterns are the mechanical form of
# that rule: an absent-minded "git add -A" cannot ship a source.
*.tex
*.bib
*.bst
*.sty
*.cls

# LaTeX build intermediates, in case anything is ever compiled in this tree.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

.DS_Store
